#: rc.cpp:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Keramik"
msgstr "Keramik"

#: rc.cpp:4
#, no-c-format
msgid "Display the window &icon in the caption bubble"
msgstr "Vertoon die venster ikoon in die kas-tipe borrel"

#: rc.cpp:6
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the window icon to be displayed in the caption "
"bubble next to the titlebar text."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie opsie as jy wil hê die venster ikoon na wees vertoon in "
"die kas-tipe borrel volgende na die titelbar teks."

#: rc.cpp:8
#, no-c-format
msgid "Draw &small caption bubbles on active windows"
msgstr "Teken klein kas-tipe borrels op aktief vensters"

#: rc.cpp:10
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the caption bubble to have the same size on "
"active windows that it has on inactive ones. This option is useful for "
"laptops or low resolution displays where you want maximize the amount of "
"space available to the window contents."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie opsie as jy wil hê die kas-tipe borrel na het die selfde "
"grootte op aktief vensters wat dit het op onaktiewe ene. hierdie opsie is "
"bruikbare vir skootrekenaars van lae opkyk vertoon waar jy wil hê maksimeer "
"die hoeveelheid van spasie beskikbaar na die venster inhoud."

#: rc.cpp:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "Draw g&rab bars below windows"
msgstr "Teken gryp stawe onder vensters"

#: rc.cpp:14
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want a grab bar to be drawn below windows. When "
"this option is not selected only a thin border will be drawn in its place."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie opsie as jy wil hê 'n gryp kolom na wees geteken onder "
"vensters. Wanneer hierdie opsie is nie gekose slegs 'n dun grens sal wees "
"geteken in sy plek."

#: rc.cpp:16
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use shadowed &text"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:18
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the titlebar text to have a 3D look with a "
"shadow behind it."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie opsie as jy wil hê die titelbar teks na het 'n 3d kyk met "
"'n skadu agter dit."

